# Naver source smoke requests.
# Direct Naver API HUB calls verify credentials/API availability.
# App calls verify PostForge source adapters, mapping, persistence, and metrics.
# Naver Shopping search ended on 2026-07-31 and has no API HUB replacement.
# Keep real API keys and access tokens in local IDE environment variables.

@appBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@naverApiHubBaseUrl = https://naverapihub.apigw.ntruss.com
@naverApiHubApiKeyId = paste-naver-api-hub-api-key-id-here
@naverApiHubApiKey = paste-naver-api-hub-api-key-here
@adminAccessToken = paste-admin-access-token-here
@monitoringUsername = monitor
@monitoringPassword = monitor-secret

### Direct Naver API HUB News search: verify external API and credentials
GET {{naverApiHubBaseUrl}}/search/v1/news?query=아이폰%20출시&display=5&start=1&sort=date
X-NCP-APIGW-API-KEY-ID: {{naverApiHubApiKeyId}}
X-NCP-APIGW-API-KEY: {{naverApiHubApiKey}}

### App manual news document collection: ADMIN, fetches Naver News and stores document chunks/embeddings
# Requires NAVER_NEWS_ENABLED=true and NAVER_API_HUB_API_KEY_ID/NAVER_API_HUB_API_KEY.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/news-documents/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "가격",
    "예약판매"
  ]
}

### App manual launch-news posting: ADMIN, may create PRODUCT_LAUNCH_NEWS posts
# Use carefully: this can create posts after Naver News gate + AI draft generation.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/launch-news/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "dailyCap": 1,
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "공식 발표"
  ]
}

### App Naver source metrics: verify external_naver_fetch_* metrics
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{monitoringUsername}} {{monitoringPassword}}
